  "details": "The new camera on VRChat 2021.4.1 feels great to use with depth of field, aperture and auto focus settings. However, I think it'd allow a wider range of photography if we were able to modify exposure and color temp in-engine. I feel like these settings are standard in most cameras and would be useful to most players looking to experiment with different effects in their photos without having to use an external editing tool.",
